  "html": "<section id=\"cw-layout-editorial\" class=\"cw-reading-rhythm-v3\" style=\"background-color: #fbfcf8; box-sizing: border-box; color: #344239; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; overflow-wrap: anywhere; padding: 22px; padding-left: 24px; padding-right: 24px; padding-top: 0; width: 100%; word-break: break-word\"><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"><section style=\"background-color: rgb(237, 243, 233); box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; max-width: 100%; padding: 24px 22px; text-align: left; width: 100%;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(52, 66, 57); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0px; text-align: left; width: 100%;\">开场第一段：比赛结束后，人们先看到了比分。阅读一篇文章，也需要先交代背景，让读者知道事情从哪里开始。</p></section><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\">开场第二段：比分接近，真正需要讨论的是关键时刻的判断。连续的正文应留在同一个阅读容器里，左右都应有清楚的留白。</p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\">开场第三段：接下来再进入具体章节。段落数量改变时，不应丢失内容，不应贴边，也不应为每段重复一层巨大的卡片内边距。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499951360447-b19be8fe80f5?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"桌面上的阅读与写作\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\"><section style=\"background-color: #edf3e9; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 22px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"color: #344239; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">从标题开始，建立阅读节奏</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px 0 0 auto; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 0 8px; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\">标题需要一个清楚的重心。<strong style=\"font-weight: 700\">重点句只强调一次</strong>，其余正文让段落长度、行距和留白承担节奏。</p><blockquote style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; color: #344239; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; padding: 12px 16px 12px; text-align: left\"><p style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; margin: 0 0 12px\">排版的任务，是把内容的关系呈现出来。</p></blockquote><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left\">每种风格都应该有自己的声音，同时让正文保持完整、清楚和可读。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\"><section style=\"background-color: #edf3e9; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 22px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"color: #344239; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">三个可以马上检查的地方</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px auto 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 0 8px; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\"><ul style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #637062; margin: 0 0 16px; padding-bottom: 14px; padding-left: 22px; text-align: left\"><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">标题是否有独立的视觉重心</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">章节之间是否留出呼吸空间</li><li style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; padding-left: 3px\">重点是否与普通正文形成清楚层级</li></ul><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1455390582262-044cdead277a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"写作中的页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515378791036-0648a3ef77b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"工作台上的笔记\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; color: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-size: 15px; line-height: inherit; margin: 20px 0 20px; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background-color: #4a7454; border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">检查项</th><th style=\"background-color: #4a7454; border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; color: #ffffff; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">观察方式</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">标题</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">第一眼能否找到主题</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">正文</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">是否能够连续阅读</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">引用</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #c9d6ca; padding: 9px 8px; vertical-align: top; word-break: break-word\">是否与作者叙述区分</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; margin-bottom: 0; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544947950-fa07a98d237f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"打开的杂志与页面\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 24px 0 24px; margin-bottom: 0\"><section style=\"background-color: #edf3e9; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 16px 22px 16px; padding-bottom: 12px; padding-top: 16px; width: 100%\"><h2 style=\"color: #344239; font-family: Georgia, 'Songti SC', SimSun, serif; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left; text-indent: 0\">把风格落实到每一个细节</h2></section><section style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 12px 0 0 auto; margin-bottom: 0; margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; padding: 0 0 8px; padding-bottom: 0; width: 100%\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\">报纸用硬边栏线建立秩序，杂志用大留白放慢速度，信笺让段落像一次自然的交谈。</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.8; margin: 20px 0 20px; text-align: left\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1481627834876-b7833e8f5570?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=85\" alt=\"阅读中的书页\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; width: 100%\"></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 16px; text-align: left\">一个完整的句子，不应该为了装饰被删掉。一张原有的表格，也不应该被换成没有事实来源的数字。</p><section style=\"border-top: 1px solid #4a7454; margin: 20px 0 0; margin-bottom: 0; padding: 12px 0 0\"><p style=\"border-top: 2px solid #4a7454; color: #344239; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0 0 0; padding: 12px 0 0; text-align: left\">读完之后，留下一个清楚的观点，比留下许多重复的色块更有价值。</p></section></section></section></section></section>",
  "name": "草绿扉页"
}
